# AI Investment Strategist — Phase 1 & 2 Audit Report

**Date:** May 15, 2026  
**Scope:** Phase 1 (Backend Foundation) and Phase 2 (Data Integration Layer) per Design Doc v2.1  
**Methodology:** Full source reading of every file in `backend/`, comparison against every acceptance criterion, test run, and lint check.

---

## Test & Lint Summary

| Metric | Result |
|:---|:---|
| Tests collected | 120 |
| Tests passed | **120 / 120** ✅ |
| Tests failed | 0 |
| `ruff check .` | **All checks passed** ✅ |
| Integration tests skipped | DB integration tests skip gracefully when Postgres is not running |

