## Verdict

| Phase | Feature Cards | Completed | Status |
|:---|:---:|:---:|:---|
| **Phase 1** | P1-01 through P1-04 | **4 / 4** | ✅ **Complete** |
| **Phase 2** | P2-01 through P2-05 | **5 / 5** | ✅ **Complete** |

**All 9 feature cards pass their acceptance criteria.** The codebase is well-structured, thoroughly tested (120/120 passing), lint-clean, and faithful to the design document. The issues identified are minor and none block progression to Phase 3.

The project is **ready to begin Phase 3: Multi-Agent Reasoning System**.
